{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_31583","headline":"薛侍御处乞鞾 · 李羣玉","name":"薛侍御处乞鞾","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"越客南来夸桂麖，良工用意巧缝成。\n看时共说茱萸皱，着处嫌无鸜鹆鸣。\n百里奚身悲甚似，五羊皮价敢全轻。\n日於文苑陪高步，赢得芳尘接武名。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李羣玉","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_31583.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_31583","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}